# Whitelist: the image is built only from the POM and the main sources. Everything else stays out of the build
# context: .git, target/, tests, validation evidence, docker/ dev files, .env files and any other local secret.
*
!pom.xml
!src/
src/test/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
